{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/425028e7c299b5cd18e5316457681cb7.avif?t=1754183941\" width=184 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Tsukumogami</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inanimate objects that gain consciousness after a long time. It's believed that they can sometimes take human form.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lonely candle suddenly inhabits a spirit: a beautiful and curvaceous woman. Stuck behind a locked door, she must find the key to unlock it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the ability to transform and slow down time, she uses her new body to escape the dangerous dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layers of Bust creates a zen yet adrenaline-filled experience. RNG is constantly changing patterns and outcomes, so each time you play will be different. Slow down time and stay alive as you collect points and power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/5142b40ca787430236aa22d5aad5ebf4.avif?t=1754183941\" width=800 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge moving pillars in this top-down, never-ending, grid-based movement experience. Watch out for the bottomless pit, collapsing ground, and secret enemies <i>like cute ducks</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things will start to speed up, so sometimes you gotta slow down, literally. Slow down time to survive seemingly impossible circumstances, and grab a variety of power-ups to get the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/c453adfed83bce1b41a8fcca630bca3f.avif?t=1754183941\" width=800 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTAINS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute, voluptuous girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large selection of outfits to wear. <i>(And take off.)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades,\u00a0Challenges, Achievements and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of areas to play in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/1d3aa5884a78ed2af85535e350548f3c.avif?t=1754183941\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I'm a Tsukumogami!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772430/d8fc064b35c63e0d0405cdc8c6e44c3e96597e68.jpg"},{"name":"Down I Go!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772430/02152313464034a9ba04ddf7a74aa7232a0d823e.jpg"},{"name":"Wet and Slippery.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772430/0af20ace697657f19faec8d419d7fc1168e64863.jpg"},{"name":"No Tap Outs.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772430/3801e2511fd0cd9148191dc7d86f4e0a5d352e38.jpg"},{"name":"Feisty.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772430/0e5f28acf41c73888b8899eb5af861cc4a875fb5.jpg"},{"name":"Where's my Prince Charming?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772430/fb2ecc9ddc5fed1b46db6208580758af4a3971ac.jpg"},{"name":"There's my Prince Charming!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap